[I] The PyQt build system

[T] PyQt-builder is the PEP 517 compliant build system for PyQt and
[T] projects that extend PyQt. It extends the SIP build system and
[T] uses Qt's qmake to perform the actual compilation and
[T] installation of extension modules.

[U] https://github.com/Python-PyQt/PyQt-builder

